Activates the LeMaker 7" LVDS LCD (1024x600) with FT5x06 touch on the LCD
connector of the LeMaker Banana Pro

Uses pins PD0-PD9 (LVDS0), PB2 (PWM0 backlight), PH8 (backlight enable),
PH12 (panel power), PI0/PI1 (I2C3), PH9 (touch IRQ), PH7 (touch reset)

Pixel clock 55 MHz (about 64 Hz). Use lemaker-lcd7-hdmi if an HDMI
monitor is connected too
